  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is suspended by a light vertical inelastic string of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> from a fixed support. At its equilibrium position, it is projected horizontally with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>6</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi></msqrt></math>. What is the ratio of the tension in the string in its horizontal position to when the particle is vertically above the point of support? &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "For a given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0023824_AnsExp_2.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 326px; height: 155px;\" /><br />At the horizontal position,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>4&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mg</mtext></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .......... (i)<br /><br />At the highest point<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>2&nbsp;</mtext><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mgT</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mg</mtext></math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ......... (ii)<br /><br />From the above equations, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
